      "name": "UNU-compatible Tune Kit",
      "description": "Used for modifying and tuning vehicle handling\nMust remain on vehicle to function, and must be removed when modifying vehicles with the default Configurator.\nHowever, modifications are saved to this part, and will resume when this part is replaced!\n\nMake that vehicle yours with the power of IVLabs!",
